.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt FILE 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm file
.Nd classify files by content and type
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl b
.Op Fl i
.Ar path ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility classifies each
.Ar path
as text, binary data, an ELF image, a directory, a symbolic link, a FIFO or a device/socket.
.Pp
The options are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl b
Omit the path prefix from each output line.
.It Fl i
Print MIME types instead of descriptive text.
.El
.Pp
The optional
.Fl m
magic-file option is not implemented; an unknown option is a usage error.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A path that cannot be inspected exits with status 1; a usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr find 1 ,
.Xr ls 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
